Mon Tue Wed Thu Fri Sat 

NOTE: The first line is the HOURS that your system will attempt to SEND
      out FAX mail. Each hour is in the 24 hour format from 0 being midnight
      and 23 being 11pm. 
      
      YOU MUST seperate each number with a - on each side.
      
      The second line is the DAYS that your system will attempt to FAX. There
      is no need to use the - to seperate here, but I suggest you place a
      space after each day just to make it easy to read. The days MUST be
      the first three letters of the day name or more.
      
      These days and times only effect the actual calling out from your BBS.
      users can write FAX mail at any time. Their messages will simply be
      stored until one of these times are reached.
      
      (This may be over ridden by the AutoFAX program's ForceFAX switch)